category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libX11-xcb1 libX11_6 libxcb1
sdesc: "C library for selecting an OpenGL API and window system at runtime (runtime)"
ldesc: "Waffle is a cross-platform library that allows one to defer selection of an
OpenGL API and of window system until runtime. For example, on Linux, Waffle
enables an application to select X11/EGL with an OpenGL 3.3 core profile,
Wayland with OpenGL ES2, and other window system / API combinations."
external-source: waffle

